Backlog.md
----------

Backlog.md (https://github.com/MrLesk/Backlog.md) shaped three parts of
this project. No code was taken from it. Its implementation is
TypeScript and nothing here is adapted from it, so no file carries a
Backlog.md header and the MIT conditions on copying are not triggered.
This credit is recorded because the ideas decided real design, not
because a license compels it.

What was taken:

  The acceptance criteria and definition of done fields. docs/plan.md
  section 16 names Backlog.md as their source, and the README says the
  same where it compares the prior projects.

  The refreshable instruction block. `git ticket instructions --write`
  replaces an earlier block in place, and cli/instructions.md opens
  with a <!-- git-ticket:begin --> marker. That is the marker-delimited
  design proposed in section D of docs/review-backlog-md.md.

  The cross-branch reads behind `git ticket refs`. Plan section 8,
  under "Reading tickets from other branches", records that the 30-day
  window comes from the same section D.

